From: UMP <ump@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 30/90] java mods: the Java mods' tick is its own span in the
 slow-tick line

HORIZON_SPIKES' slow ticks now name tick_java (wall/cpu), so the mods' share of a long server tick shows beside Horizon's own steps.
---
 crates/horizon-client/src/game.rs | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/crates/horizon-client/src/game.rs b/crates/horizon-client/src/game.rs
index bdca53669f..b67dfc3993 100644
--- a/crates/horizon-client/src/game.rs
+++ b/crates/horizon-client/src/game.rs
@@ -7948,7 +7948,8 @@ impl Game<'_> {
         self.tick_command_extras();
         self.native_tick();
         self.tell_native_now();
-        self.tick_java_server();
+        // Its own span in the slow-tick line (HORIZON_SPIKES), with the Java mods' share.
+        horizon_client::spans::time("tick_java", || self.tick_java_server());
         self.tick_world(running)
     }
     /// What the tick runs after the local player's own update: effects, the
